  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have installed fcrepo4-oaiprovider-4.2.0 on Fedora 4.2.0 (plus-rbacl-audit). I have added sets using command below.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "curl -X POST ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo-webapp-plus-rbacl-audit-4.2.0/rest/oai/sets"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo-webapp-plus-rbacl-audit-4.2.0/rest/oai/sets",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " -H \"Content-Type: text/xml\" -d @oai_set.xml -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here is my @oai_set.xml",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"yes\"?>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<set xmlns:ns2=\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<ns2:setSpec>oai-test-set</ns2:setSpec>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<ns2:setName>oai-test-set</ns2:setName>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</set>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It was working for the first set. I have added another set, oai-test-set-2 and then list the set by using oai?verb=ListSets, but the response showed only first set.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here are my questions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "How can I make the OAI Provider to show all sets?",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "How can I update or delete oai set?",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
